{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Portal Factory</strong> is an open-world factory-building adventure where exploration meets engineering! Play solo or with friends as you dive into a vibrant world. Harness the power of advanced technology to build complex factory systems that automate resource gathering, crafting, and production. As your operations grow, explore the far reaches of the world to uncover hidden dungeons filled with mysteries and valuable rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328810/extras/49d1d65ec3ca602dc9fce50b8eef4bd7.poster.avif?t=1751021062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328810/extras/49d1d65ec3ca602dc9fce50b8eef4bd7.mp4?t=1751021062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BASE BUILDING:</strong> Design and optimize your factory layout as you automate the production of resources. Expand your operations from small workshops to sprawling industrial hubs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328810/extras/b87b13f2bd40ed6834c17f0f86575b8b.poster.avif?t=1751021062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3328810/extras/b87b13f2bd40ed6834c17f0f86575b8b.mp4?t=1751021062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DIVERSE BIOMES</strong>: From lush forests to barren deserts, venture through a variety of landscapes, each with unique resources and challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=